<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 11.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 11.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on September 11.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				 Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		    Yield     Close</p>
<p>1  Kalamazoo Hlds	  19.57     2.35</p>
<p>2  Central Norseman	14.46     0.83</p>
<p>3  Telecasters Nqld	12.96     5.40</p>
<p>4  Pac Mutual Aust	 12.45     2.41</p>
<p>5  Kurts (P) Prop	  10.56     1.42</p>
<p>6  Prime Credit Tr	 10.43     0.94</p>
<p>7  Indu Property	   10.34     0.88</p>
<p>8  Prop Income Inv	 10.11     1.01</p>
<p>9  BT Prop Trust	    9.83     1.66</p>
<p>10 Colonial Mutual	  9.80     1.08</p>
<p>11 Villa World		9.71     1.03</p>
<p>12 Blackmores Lab	   9.70     3.30</p>
<p>13 Multistack		 9.68     0.31</p>
<p>14 Central Equity	   9.47     0.95</p>
